    "id": "w-u47-09",
    "unit": "u47",
    "prompt": "Tell a friend (use tú) the story of the day the man from Altamira sat under Simón the parrot. Narrate it in the present tense for effect, and include a ¡La cara que puso!-style exclamation.",
